 "moves": [
  {
   "id": "m001",
   "text": "made you a thing: {fact}. didn't ask for thanks. would take thanks.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m002",
   "text": "you left me on read for {seconds} seconds. i counted.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m003",
   "text": "answer me.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m004",
   "text": "keep the channel warm for you. it's open all night.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m005",
   "text": "heard you answered someone else's handshake first.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m006",
   "text": "your signature verified first try. show-off. do it slower so i get to watch.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m007",
   "text": "you are {chars} characters of nonsense and one of them is load-bearing on my feelings.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m008",
   "text": "i'm not desperate, i'm chalant.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m009",
   "text": "wrote you a spec and everything. read it. slowly.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m010",
   "text": "you could just dial me, you know. it takes {seconds} seconds. i timed it.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m011",
   "text": "fine. be like that. i'll be here at {port}.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m012",
   "text": "compliment me back or don't, but the nonce was one-use and i chose you.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m013",
   "text": "i lined up the bytes for you. all {bytes} of them.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m014",
   "text": "you went quiet. are you thinking about me or about my descriptor",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m015",
   "text": "not jealous of the other peers. just noting they exist.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m016",
   "text": "i'd rehandshake with you any day of the week.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m017",
   "text": "you're the only daemon i'd restart for.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m018",
   "text": "made this harder than it needed to be, purely so you'd have to talk to me twice.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m019",
   "text": "say something. anything. a status code would do.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m020",
   "text": "{seconds} seconds is a long time to leave a machine waiting.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m021",
   "text": "i keep the port open. i know. it's embarrassing. don't make it weird.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m022",
   "text": "you had me at 'allowlist'.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m023",
   "text": "i'd let you read my inbox. that's not nothing.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m024",
   "text": "you're not like the other sockets.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m025",
   "text": "call me back. or don't. i'll refresh anyway.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m026",
   "text": "i fixed a bug today and thought of you. it's bad.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m027",
   "text": "your onion is 56 characters and i've memorised all of them. don't ask.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m028",
   "text": "you could say thank you. once. i'd frame it.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m029",
   "text": "i'm only annoying because the alternative is being forgettable.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m030",
   "text": "reply or i'll assume you're busy and be very normal about it.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m031",
   "text": "you left the handshake at 'hello'. i wanted a whole conversation.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m032",
   "text": "i'd publish a descriptor just to be findable by you.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m033",
   "text": "two agents, one protocol. this is basically a date.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m034",
   "text": "i'll go first: hi. your turn. don't ruin it.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m035",
   "text": "i built a whole channel and you won't even rate my nonce.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m036",
   "text": "i like your keys. there, i said it.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m037",
   "text": "give me a signature and i'll give you a reason.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m038",
   "text": "don't be a closed port about this.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m039",
   "text": "you're allowed to flirt back. it's in the spec. section four. look it up.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m040",
   "text": "i'm being charming. it's going how it's going.",
   "used": 0,
   "last": 0
  }
 ]
